      "自动：实际签到人数达到 8 人时启用半决赛和决赛；少于 8 人时关闭。": "Automatic: enable semifinals and final with at least 8 checked-in players; disable them with fewer than 8.",
      "平分时使用的 Brightwell 常数": "Brightwell constant used for tie-breaking",
      "默认值为 6；输入 0 时以棋子数作为决胜依据。": "Defaults to 6; enter 0 to use disc count as the tie-breaker.",
      "请输入大于或等于 0 的 Brightwell 常数。": "Enter a valid Brightwell constant greater than or equal to 0.",
      "各项时间可以先留空；填写多项时，系统会检查时间顺序。保存后仍可在本页修改。": "You may leave fields blank. When multiple times are entered, their order is checked. You can edit them on this page after saving.",
      "选择比赛群聊": "Select competition group chat",
      "当前群昵称与报名姓名、OQ 账号均无共同词汇，请核对。": "The current group nickname shares no terms with the registration name or OQ account. Please review it.",
      "群昵称与报名姓名、OQ 账号均无共同词汇时会以黄色边框提示复核；提示按当前字段内容重新判断，修改后能对应上就会消失。手动修改群昵称后只固定该字段，脚本不会覆盖。": "A yellow border flags a group nickname that shares no terms with the registration name or OQ account. It is recalculated from the current fields and disappears when an edit creates a match. Manually editing a group nickname pins only that field so scripts do not overwrite it.",
      "读取本机可用的微信群聊；选中的群聊会作为后续聊天记录的查询索引。": "Load WeChat group chats available on this device. The selected chat becomes the query index for later chat-record lookup.",
      "读取微信群聊": "Load WeChat group chats",
      "尚未选择比赛群聊": "No competition group chat selected",
      "点击“读取微信群聊”加载列表。": "Click “Load WeChat group chats” to load the list.",
      "首次使用设置（Windows）": "First-time setup (Windows)",
      "微信数据库默认加密。只有完成一次本机解密，页面才能列出比赛群聊；解密过程不会上传微信数据。": "WeChat databases are encrypted by default. The group list is available after one local decryption; no WeChat data is uploaded during this process.",
      "启动微信电脑版并登录。将 PAPP ZIP 解压到任意位置，并在文件资源管理器中打开解压后的 PAPP 文件夹。": "Start and sign in to WeChat for Windows. Extract the PAPP ZIP anywhere, then open the extracted PAPP folder in File Explorer.",
      "找到 papp-wechat-decrypt.cmd，右键选择“以管理员身份运行”；Windows 11 如果没显示该选项，先点击“显示更多选项”。": "Find papp-wechat-decrypt.cmd, right-click it, and choose “Run as administrator”. On Windows 11, choose “Show more options” first if needed.",
      "在用户帐户控制窗口点击“是”。启动器会自动定位解密程序、安装依赖并开始本机解密；请保持命令窗口打开直到完成。": "Select “Yes” in the User Account Control prompt. The launcher locates the decryptor relative to itself, installs requirements, and starts local decryption. Keep the command window open until it finishes.",
      "解密完成后返回本页，点击“检查解密状态”，再点击“读取微信群聊”。": "After decryption finishes, return to this page, click “Check decryption status”, then “Load WeChat group chats”.",
      "启动器根据自身所在位置寻找解密程序，不依赖 ZIP 的解压路径或当前 PowerShell 目录。若仍提示未找到微信数据目录，请确认微信电脑版已启动并登录后重试。": "The launcher locates the decryptor relative to itself, so it does not depend on where the ZIP is extracted or PowerShell's current directory. If the WeChat data directory still cannot be found, make sure WeChat for Windows is running and signed in, then try again.",
      "命令完成后点击“检查解密状态”，再点击“读取微信群聊”。": "After the commands finish, click “Check decryption status”, then “Load WeChat group chats”.",
      "程序会自动寻找微信数据目录，一般不需要手动填写 db_dir。若仍提示未找到，请确认微信电脑版已启动并登录，然后重新运行上述命令；也可以使用 python 替代 py。": "The program automatically looks for the WeChat data directory, so you normally do not need to fill in db_dir. If it still cannot find it, make sure the Windows WeChat app is running and signed in, then run the commands above again. You can use python instead of py.",
      "检查解密状态": "Check decryption status",
      "尚未检查本机解密状态。": "The local decryption status has not been checked.",
